d":120},"6ae9da5d2756dce0f10604ee",{"id":122},"6aad520fe6ebe5c3c1970865",[],{"heading":125,"keywordsHeading":126,"signature":127},"Make it clear.\nMake it feel right.","A few things I work with","In ♥ with pixels"],"uses":{}},{"type":"data","data":[{"suggestedProjects":1,"project":27},[2,16],{"id":3,"slug":4,"title":5,"shortTitle":5,"tagline":6,"year":7,"isFeatured":8,"featuredImage":9,"videoCover":15},"6ac8b04e1617bfc2eb4349f3","berachain","Berachain","Designing the face of a blockchain","2026-04-01T12:00:00.000Z",true,{"previewDataURL":10,"url":11,"alt":12,"width":13,"height":14},"data:image/jpeg;base64,","/media/berachain-cover.png","Berachain landing page hero section",1920,1080,null,{"id":17,"slug":18,"title":19,"shortTitle":20,"tagline":21,"year":22,"isFeatured":8,"featuredImage":23,"videoCover":15},"6aad520fe6ebe5c3c1970865","smilee","Smilee Finance","Smilee","Building a scalable DeFi ecosystem","2025-05-01T12:00:00.000Z",{"previewDataURL":24,"url":25,"alt":26,"width":13,"height":14},"data:image/jpeg;base64,","/media/smilee-cover.png","Smilee Finance cover",{"id":28,"slug":29,"title":30,"shortTitle":31,"tagline":32,"year":33,"isFeatured":8,"isMinor":34,"client":31,"role":35,"output":36,"featuredImage":37,"videoCover":15,"links":41,"collaborators":45,"contentHtml":46,"createdAt":47,"updatedAt":48},"6ae9da5d2756dce0f10604ee","aura","Aura.money","Aura","Building a social trading app","2025-01-01T12:00:00.000Z",false,"UX/UI & Frontend Dev","iOS & Android App",{"previewDataURL":38,"url":39,"alt":40,"width":13,"height":14},"data:image/jpeg;base64,","/media/aura-cover.png","Aura trading app on a phone against a blue sky and clouds",[42],{"label":43,"url":44},"aura.money","https://aura.money/",[],"\u003Ch1>Overview\u003C/h1>\u003Ch2>Aura.money\u003C/h2>\u003Cp>Aura brings on-chain trading into a single app, reducing the need to move between separate platforms and wallets. The product combines Hyperliquid trading with Polymarket prediction markets, bringing different types of markets into one interface. My work focused on UX/UI and frontend development, including the app’s social features.\u003C/p>\u003Cdiv class=\"media-layout media-layout--grid\">\u003Cdiv class=\"media-layout-row media-layout-row--columns-1\">\u003Cspan data-media data-media-state=\"loading\" class=\"media-frame\">\u003Cimg data-preview src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"media-preview\" />\u003Cimg src=\"/media/aura-bento.png\" alt=\"Aura brand and product presentation\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" />\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cp>\u003Cbr />\u003C/p>\u003Ch1>Branding\u003C/h1>\u003Ch2>A clear brand identity\u003C/h2>\u003Cp>Aura’s visual identity draws on an “old money” aesthetic, evoking timeless wealth, exclusivity, and understated luxury. This direction gives the product a distinctive character and a consistent visual foundation for the interface.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>The brand identity was translated into a defined design system and carried through the app’s components and screens.\u003C/p>\u003Cdiv class=\"media-layout media-layout--grid\">\u003Cdiv class=\"media-layout-row media-layout-row--columns-2\">\u003Cspan data-media data-media-state=\"loading\" class=\"media-frame\">\u003Cimg data-preview src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"media-preview\" />\u003Cimg src=\"/media/aura-logo-dark.png\" alt=\"Aura logo dark on light background\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" />\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-media data-media-state=\"loading\" class=\"media-frame\">\u003Cimg data-preview src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"media-preview\" />\u003Cimg src=\"/media/aura-logo-light.png\" alt=\"Aura logo light on dark background\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" />\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"media-layout-row media-layout-row--columns-1\">\u003Cspan data-media data-media-state=\"loading\" class=\"media-frame\">\u003Cimg data-preview src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"media-preview\" />\u003Cimg src=\"/media/aura-typography.png\" alt=\"Aura typographic styles and compositions\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1296\" loading=\"lazy\" />\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"media-layout-row media-layout-row--columns-1\">\u003Cdiv data-media data-media-state=\"loading\" class=\"media-frame\">\u003Cimg data-preview src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"media-preview\" />\u003Cvideo data-deferred preload=\"none\" poster=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" data-src=\"/media/aura-x-polymarke.webm\" data-autoplay muted loop playsinline>\u003C/video>\u003Cnoscript>\u003Cvideo controls preload=\"none\" poster=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" src=\"/media/aura-x-polymarke.webm\" muted loop playsinline>\u003C/video>\u003C/noscript>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"media-layout-row media-layout-row--columns-2\">\u003Cspan data-media data-media-state=\"loading\" class=\"media-frame\">\u003Cimg data-preview src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"media-preview\" />\u003Cimg src=\"/media/aura-imagery-1.png\" alt=\"Aura graphic with text\" width=\"1200\" height=\"920\" loading=\"lazy\" />\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-media data-media-state=\"loading\" class=\"media-frame\">\u003Cimg data-preview src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"media-preview\" />\u003Cimg src=\"/media/aura-imagery-3.png\" alt=\"Aura graphic with image and text\" width=\"1200\" height=\"920\" loading=\"lazy\" />\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"media-layout-row media-layout-row--columns-2\">\u003Cspan data-media data-media-state=\"loading\" class=\"media-frame\">\u003Cimg data-preview src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"media-preview\" />\u003Cimg src=\"/media/aura-imagery-2.png\" alt=\"Aura graphic with image and text\" width=\"1200\" height=\"920\" loading=\"lazy\" />\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-media data-media-state=\"loading\" class=\"media-frame\">\u003Cimg data-preview src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"media-preview\" />\u003Cimg src=\"/media/aura-imagery-4.png\" alt=\"Aura graphic with text\" width=\"1200\" height=\"920\" loading=\"lazy\" />\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cp>\u003Cbr />\u003C/p>\u003Ch1>The challenge\u003C/h1>\u003Ch2>Creating a social layer\u003C/h2>\u003Cp>I worked on groups, trading competitions, and an activity feed, bringing a social dimension to the trading experience. These features connected individual trading activity with community participation: groups brought users together, competitions added a shared challenge, and the feed made activity visible in one place.\u003C/p>\u003Cdiv class=\"media-layout media-layout--grid\">\u003Cdiv class=\"media-layout-row media-layout-row--columns-1\">\u003Cspan data-media data-media-state=\"loading\" class=\"media-frame\">\u003Cimg data-preview src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"media-preview\" />\u003Cimg src=\"/media/aura-social-features.png\" alt=\"Aura social features screens\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" />\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"media-layout-row media-layout-row--columns-2\">\u003Cspan data-media data-media-state=\"loading\" class=\"media-frame\">\u003Cimg data-preview src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"media-preview\" />\u003Cimg src=\"/media/aura-group-user-actions.png\" alt=\"Aura group user actions\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" />\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-media data-media-state=\"loading\" class=\"media-frame\">\u003Cimg data-preview src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"media-preview\" />\u003Cimg src=\"/media/aura-daily-missions.png\" alt=\"Aura daily missions\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" />\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"media-layout-row media-layout-row--columns-1\">\u003Cspan data-media data-media-state=\"loading\" class=\"media-frame\">\u003Cimg data-preview src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"media-preview\" />\u003Cimg src=\"/media/aura-activity-cards.png\" alt=\"Aura activity cards\" width=\"1920\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" />\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cp>\u003Cbr />\u003C/p>\u003Cp>\u003Cbr />\u003C/p>\u003Ch1>Tech stack\u003C/h1>\u003Ch2>Building a native app\u003C/h2>\u003Cp>The app was built with React Native for iOS and Android. We used native components and interaction patterns, including stack navigation and modals, to make the experience feel familiar on each platform. Working across UX/UI and frontend development helped me design with those capabilities in mind.\u003C/p>\u003Cdiv class=\"media-layout media-layout--grid\">\u003Cdiv class=\"media-layout-row media-layout-row--columns-2\">\u003Cspan data-media data-media-state=\"loading\" class=\"media-frame\">\u003Cimg data-preview src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"media-preview\" />\u003Cimg src=\"/media/aura-predictions.png\" alt=\"Aura prediction page\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-media data-media-state=\"loading\" class=\"media-frame\">\u003Cimg data-preview src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"media-preview\" />\u003Cimg src=\"/media/aura-transfer-receipt.png\" alt=\"Aura transfer receipt modal\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"media-layout-row media-layout-row--columns-2\">\u003Cspan data-media data-media-state=\"loading\" class=\"media-frame\">\u003Cimg data-preview src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"media-preview\" />\u003Cimg src=\"/media/aura-select-receipt.png\" alt=\"Aura token selection modal\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-media data-media-state=\"loading\" class=\"media-frame\">\u003Cimg data-preview src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"media-preview\" />\u003Cimg src=\"/media/aura-portoflio.png\" alt=\"Aura portfolio page\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"media-layout-row media-layout-row--columns-1\">\u003Cspan data-media data-media-state=\"loading\" class=\"media-frame\">\u003Cimg data-preview src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"media-preview\" />\u003Cimg src=\"/media/aura-design-document-3.png\" alt=\"Aura design document\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1432\" loading=\"lazy\" />\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"media-layout-row media-layout-row--columns-2\">\u003Cspan data-media data-media-state=\"loading\" class=\"media-frame\">\u003Cimg data-preview src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"media-preview\" />\u003Cimg src=\"/media/aura-design-document-1.png\" alt=\"Aura design document\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1765\" loading=\"lazy\" />\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-media data-media-state=\"loading\" class=\"media-frame\">\u003Cimg data-preview src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"media-preview\" />\u003Cimg src=\"/media/aura-design-document-2.png\" alt=\"Aura design document\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1765\" loading=\"lazy\" />\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cp>\u003Cbr />\u003C/p>\u003Cp>\u003Cbr />\u003C/p>\u003Ch1>What I learned\u003C/h1>\u003Ch2>Design for the platform\u003C/h2>\u003Cp>Designing for native environments taught me to build on the interactions people use every day. A consistent product can still offer slightly different experiences on iOS and Android, following the conventions users already know.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>Understanding React Native helped me make better UX decisions. Knowing how native components behave made it easier to choose the right interaction for each flow and connect design decisions to implementation.\u003C/p>","2026-11-03T12:58:05.725Z","2026-11-11T15:42:06.412Z"],"uses":{"params":["slug"],"parent":1}}]}
